# Tangram — CODEOWNERS
#
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners.
# Order matters — the LAST matching pattern wins for a given path.
#
# Code owners are automatically requested for review when someone opens
# a PR that modifies a path they own. When combined with the branch
# ruleset's "Require review from Code Owners" rule, only listed owners
# can approve PRs that touch the matching paths.

